down
file "src1.c" mono big fit
move .1
file "src2.c" mono big fit
move .1
dot
move .07
dot
move .07
dot
move .1
file "srcN.c" mono big fit

D: line from first file.nw + (-.1,.1) \
  then down until even with last file.sw - (.1,.1) \
  then right until even with last file.se + (.1,.1) \
  then up until even with first file.nw + (0,.1) \
  then to first file.nw + (-.1,.1)
text "források" with .sw at D.nw

Lbase: dot invis at .2 right of 1/2<3rd vertex of D, 4th vertex of D>
Lin: dot at Lbase +(0,.075)

spline dashed from 1st file.e right .03 then down then to Lin color red

spline dashed from 2nd file.e right .03 then to Lin color blue

box with .s at Lbase width .15 height .15 fill white
spline from 19/24<last box.nw,last box.ne> up .05 \
  then .03 heading -45 \
  then .02 heading -90 \
  then .02 heading -90 \
  then .03 heading -135 \
  then down .05
Lout: dot at Lbase +(0,.075)


T1base: dot invis at .7 right of 2/3<3rd vertex of D, 4th vertex of D>
T2base: dot invis at .7 right of 1/3<3rd vertex of D, 4th vertex of D>

sq = .2
T1: spline -> from T1base then sq heading 45 then 2*sq heading 135 then 2*sq heading 45 then 2*sq heading 135 then 2*sq heading 45 then 2*sq heading 135 color red

T2: spline -> from T2base then sq heading 45 then 2*sq heading 135 then 2*sq heading 45 then 2*sq heading 135 then 2*sq heading 45 then 2*sq heading 135 color blue


T1mf: box "MatchFinder" big fit with .nw at T1base - (-.1,.1) color red
T2mf: box "MatchFinder" big fit with .nw at T2base - (-.1,.1) color blue

spline -> dashed color red from Lout right .2 then .15 heading 40 then to T1mf.w

spline -> dashed color blue from Lout right .2 then .7 heading 170 then to T2mf.w

right
E0: box "callExpr(...)" big fit at (1,1)
move .1
E1: box "decl(...)" big fit

D: line from E0.nw + (-.1,.1) \
  then down until even with E1.sw - (.1,.1) \
  then right until even with E1.se + (.1,.1) \
  then up until even with E1.nw + (0,.1) \
  then to E0.nw + (-.1,.1)
text "keresett minták" with .sw at D.nw

spline dotted -> from T1mf.n to E0.s color T1mf.color
spline dotted -> from T1mf.n to E1.s color T1mf.color

spline dotted -> from T2mf.n up .1 then 1 heading 60 then to E0.s color T2mf.color
spline dotted -> from T2mf.n up .1 then 1 heading 60 then to E1.s color T2mf.color

